	(text_box "Notes\n1. Changing U1, U2 or U3 can result in large change in monostable output pulse duration due to capacitor leakage resistance. R,C values set for RCA version.\n2. AHB input is an OR function from both UP and DOWN controllers, retrigger input is used to maintain barrier down condition if two trains pass simultaneously"
